{"a":[3,4],"h":"<p>o zilzâl ve ihrac olduğu 3.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"174\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 173.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 31.4 39.0 45.7 61.4 61.4 72.0 90.7 90.7 97.4 97.4 102.0 109.4 125.2 135.7 142.4 149.2\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 31.4 45.7 78.7 78.7 125.2 142.4 149.2 157.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve insan buna ne oluyor; dediği vakıt -böyle denilmesi hevlin azametini tasvir içindir. Ya'ni o zelzele o ihracı her gören insan dehşetinin azametinden şaşırarak bu Arza ne oluyor? Nedir bu hal diye beht ü telâşa düştüğü o belâlı vakıt. Ba'zıları demişlerdir ki: onu gören kâfirler öyle söyliyecek « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"179\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 178.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 18.7 18.7 27.7 36.7 43.6 43.6 50.3 50.3 59.3 66.0 66.0 73.6 89.3 89.3 99.7 99.7 115.6 122.3 129.0 135.7 142.6 158.3 158.3 168.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 43.6 59.3 73.6 122.3 129.0 135.7 142.6 168.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » diyecekler, mü'minler ise « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"279\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 278.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6 21.7 21.7 39.7 39.7 47.3 47.3 56.3 56.3 63.7 79.6 91.6 100.6 114.0 131.3 131.3 141.7 141.7 150.7 150.7 162.7 162.7 170.3 177.7 193.6 202.6 211.6 228.7 235.6 251.3 258.0 267.0 267.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 28.6 28.6 79.6 91.6 100.6 114.0 162.7 193.6 202.6 211.6 235.6 258.0\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » diyecekler. Fak